SUMMARY:Big Brain Bay Area: What Happens When a Country Gets Hacked? Cyber
 war and the Systems We Depend On
DESCRIPTION:A lecture-in-a-bar talk by Nate Gleason\, who leads Lawrence L
 ivermore's cyber and infrastructure resilience programme. It covers how a
 ttacks on grids\, water and ports become physical\, 'immune infrastructur
 e'\, and how AI is changing both attack and defence.\nPrice: $27\nhttps:/
 /luma.com/lprchbdo
URL:https://luma.com/lprchbdo
LOCATION:Planted SF\, 473A Haight St\, San Francisco\, CA 94117
